# skills: Wall Breaker, with one enemy lowered beforehand. Jian at level 36 (level index 35 pinned, battle MP
# pinned to 50), first temple battle; battler 4's DEF stage (+0x42) is poked to -1 before the cast. Special
# lists six skills; Right, Right, Down is Wall Breaker (shot wl_list: 9, "Lower all monsters' defense"). A
# casts: the DEF DOWN banner shows on the four other enemies and not on battler 4, the first back-row enemy
# (wl_cast, wl_cast2); MP 50 -> 41; the DEF stage of battlers 5, 6, 9, and 10 goes to -1. Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
include warp6
include cheats_strong
pin u32 0x020B4664 35
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x18 50
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
peek u32 0x020B8550 work
watch u32 0x0228e878 jian_mp
poke u16 0x0228ea52 0xFFFF
watch u16 0x0228ea52 def_stage4
watch u16 0x0228eabe def_stage5
watch u16 0x0228eb2a def_stage6
watch u16 0x0228ec02 def_stage8
watch u16 0x0228ec6e def_stage9
watch u16 0x0228ecda def_stage10
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press Down 8
wait 50
shot wl_list
press A 8
wait 50
wait 30
shot wl_cast
wait 30
shot wl_cast2
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 8 600
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 110
shot wl_after
